## Network
- **VPC**: Virtual Private Cloud
  - Primary Network: **/19**
    - K8s API & Control-plane components
    - EC2 Instance (Nodes)
    - Other AWS Native services (ex: S3 Storage)
  - Secondary Network: **/16**
    - Pods
  - Service Network: **/16**
    - K8s Service Endpoints
> [!TIP]
> **/16** = 64k IPs | **/19** = 8k IPs | **/23** = 512 IPs | **/25** = 128 IPs

